# Applies to the REVIEWER project (Root Directory = repo root). The landing
# page is a separate Vercel project rooted at site/, so site/ is dead weight
# here -- and vice versa.
#
# Careful: this excludes files from the upload, which means the build cannot
# see them either. Everything scripts/vercel_reviewer_build.py needs at build
# time must stay: runs/realistic-seed42/ (the committed inputs), .llm_cache/
# (so the contract compile needs no API key), calibration/ (the audit reads
# the pinned artifact), and datagen/ (imported when `python -m cli` loads the
# full Typer app -- never reachable from the served application; see the
# import-closure note in requirements.txt).

site/

reviewer/web/node_modules/
reviewer/web/*.tsbuildinfo

tests/
chaos/
docs/
eval/results/

.git/
.github/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
